  "description": "RingMo-Sense is a remote sensing foundation model for spatiotemporal prediction via spatiotemporal evolution disentangling. It uses a triple-branch architecture (spatial, temporal, spatiotemporal) with progressive joint training and parameter sharing, pretrained on a large-scale, diverse remote sensing spatiotemporal dataset. It achieves competitive performance on six downstream spatiotemporal tasks.",
